{"type": "elementor", "siteurl": "https://gototherapy.co.uk", "elements": [{"id": "7a0031d", "elType": "container", "settings": {"content_width": "boxed", "flex_direction": "column", "_css_classes": "gt-section gt-section--tight gt-hero", "flex_gap": {"column": "20", "row": "20", "unit": "px", "size": 20}}, "elements": [{"id": "15e22e0", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Anxiety", "header_size": "p", "_css_classes": "gt-eyebrow"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "0fd2d74", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Talking to somebody about anxiety", "header_size": "h1", "_css_classes": "gt-h1"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "1d7a9fd", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Worry that will not settle, a body that is always braced, and the effort of hiding it. The therapists listed here say they work with anxiety, and each has had their registration, insurance and supervision checked by a person. This page describes what it can feel like, when it is worth talking to somebody, and what a first session tends to cover. It does not diagnose anything.</p>", "_css_classes": "gt-answer"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "c10a1d6", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"reviewer\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"></circle><path d=\"M12 8v4m0 4h.01\"></path></svg><p><strong>Clinical reviewer required.</strong> This page is not indexed until a named, registered clinician has reviewed it.</p></div>"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": false}, {"id": "f7bec39", "elType": "container", "settings": {"content_width": "boxed", "flex_direction": "column", "_css_classes": "gt-section gt-section--tight gt-section--flush-top", "flex_gap": {"column": "20", "row": "20", "unit": "px", "size": 20}}, "elements": [{"id": "ffb3ca0", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<!-- Functional block, kept verbatim. When the Gototherapy plugin is installed, replace with [gototherapy_therapist_grid] -->\n<div data-page=\"directory\">\n<div class=\"section__head section__head--split\">\n<h2 class=\"h2\">Verified therapists who work with anxiety</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\" data-directory-count=\"\">Loading verified profiles…</p>\n</div>\n</div>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "c8d2fc3", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<!-- Functional block, kept verbatim. When the Gototherapy plugin is installed, replace with [gototherapy_therapist_grid] -->\n<div class=\"profile-grid\" data-directory-results=\"\">\n<article class=\"card card--hover profile-card\">\n<div class=\"profile-card__badges\"><span class=\"badge badge--verified\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Register, insurance and supervision checked</span></span><span class=\"badge badge--demo\">Demo record</span></div>\n<div class=\"profile-card__top\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"avatar\">TA</span>\n<div><h3 class=\"profile-card__name\"><a href=\"/therapist/demo-therapist-a/\">Demo Therapist A</a></h3><p class=\"profile-card__role\">Counsellor (demo record)</p></div>\n</div>\n<ul class=\"profile-card__meta\"><li><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon--sm\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 21s-6-5.2-6-10a6 6 0 0 1 12 0c0 4.8-6 10-6 10z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"11\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg><span>Brighton</span></li><li><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon--sm\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" width=\"13\" x=\"3\" y=\"6\"></rect><path d=\"m16 10 5-3v10l-5-3z\"></path></svg><span>In person and Online</span></li></ul>\n<p class=\"profile-card__text\">Works with anxiety, relationships, work and stress.</p>\n</article><article class=\"card card--hover profile-card\">\n<div class=\"profile-card__badges\"><span class=\"badge badge--verified\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Register, insurance and supervision checked</span></span><span class=\"badge badge--demo\">Demo record</span></div>\n<div class=\"profile-card__top\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"avatar\">TB</span>\n<div><h3 class=\"profile-card__name\"><a href=\"/therapist/demo-therapist-b/\">Demo Therapist B</a></h3><p class=\"profile-card__role\">Psychotherapist (demo record)</p></div>\n</div>\n<ul class=\"profile-card__meta\"><li><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon--sm\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 21s-6-5.2-6-10a6 6 0 0 1 12 0c0 4.8-6 10-6 10z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"11\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg><span>Brighton</span></li><li><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon--sm\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" width=\"13\" x=\"3\" y=\"6\"></rect><path d=\"m16 10 5-3v10l-5-3z\"></path></svg><span>Online</span></li></ul>\n<p class=\"profile-card__text\">Works with anxiety, depression and low mood, bereavement and loss.</p>\n</article><article class=\"card card--hover profile-card\">\n<div class=\"profile-card__badges\"><span class=\"badge badge--verified\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Register, insurance and supervision checked</span></span><span class=\"badge badge--demo\">Demo record</span></div>\n<div class=\"profile-card__top\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"avatar\">TC</span>\n<div><h3 class=\"profile-card__name\"><a href=\"/therapist/demo-therapist-c/\">Demo Therapist C</a></h3><p class=\"profile-card__role\">Counsellor and coach (demo record)</p></div>\n</div>\n<ul class=\"profile-card__meta\"><li><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon--sm\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 21s-6-5.2-6-10a6 6 0 0 1 12 0c0 4.8-6 10-6 10z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"11\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg><span>Manchester</span></li><li><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon--sm\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" width=\"13\" x=\"3\" y=\"6\"></rect><path d=\"m16 10 5-3v10l-5-3z\"></path></svg><span>In person and Online</span></li><li><span class=\"status status--off\">Not taking new clients</span></li></ul>\n<p class=\"profile-card__text\">Works with anxiety, work and stress, self-esteem.</p>\n<p class=\"meta\">This is not a regulated profession in the UK, so there is no register to check.</p>\n</article><article class=\"card card--hover profile-card\">\n<div class=\"profile-card__badges\"><span class=\"badge badge--verified\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Register, insurance and supervision checked</span></span><span class=\"badge badge--demo\">Demo record</span></div>\n<div class=\"profile-card__top\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"avatar\">TE</span>\n<div><h3 class=\"profile-card__name\"><a href=\"/therapist/demo-therapist-e/\">Demo Therapist E</a></h3><p class=\"profile-card__role\">Counsellor (demo record)</p></div>\n</div>\n<ul class=\"profile-card__meta\"><li><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon--sm\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 21s-6-5.2-6-10a6 6 0 0 1 12 0c0 4.8-6 10-6 10z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"11\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg><span>Brighton</span></li><li><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon--sm\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" width=\"13\" x=\"3\" y=\"6\"></rect><path d=\"m16 10 5-3v10l-5-3z\"></path></svg><span>In person and Online</span></li></ul>\n<p class=\"profile-card__text\">Works with anxiety, bereavement and loss, life changes.</p>\n</article><article class=\"card card--hover profile-card\">\n<div class=\"profile-card__badges\"><span class=\"badge badge--verified\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Register, insurance and supervision training checked</span></span><span class=\"badge badge--demo\">Demo record</span></div>\n<div class=\"profile-card__top\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"avatar\">SA</span>\n<div><h3 class=\"profile-card__name\"><a href=\"/therapist/demo-supervisor-a/\">Demo Supervisor A</a></h3><p class=\"profile-card__role\">Clinical supervisor and counsellor (demo record)</p></div>\n</div>\n<ul class=\"profile-card__meta\"><li><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon--sm\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 21s-6-5.2-6-10a6 6 0 0 1 12 0c0 4.8-6 10-6 10z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"11\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg><span>Manchester</span></li><li><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon--sm\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" width=\"13\" x=\"3\" y=\"6\"></rect><path d=\"m16 10 5-3v10l-5-3z\"></path></svg><span>In person and Online</span></li></ul>\n<p class=\"profile-card__text\">Works with anxiety, depression and low mood, trauma.</p>\n</article>\n</div>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "3f91d80", "elType": "container", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "row", "_css_classes": "gt-actions", "flex_direction_tablet": "row", "flex_direction_mobile": "row", "flex_align_items": "center", "flex_gap": {"column": "12", "row": "12", "unit": "px", "size": 12}, "flex_gap_tablet": {"column": "32", "row": "32", "unit": "px", "size": 32}, "flex_wrap": "wrap"}, "elements": [{"id": "f3c3fd0", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "Filter by town or online", "link": {"url": "/find-a-therapist/?issue=anxiety", "is_external": "", "nofollow": ""}, "_css_classes": "gt-button-ghost", "size": "md"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": true}], "isInner": false}, {"id": "556202c", "elType": "container", "settings": {"content_width": "boxed", "flex_direction": "column", "_css_classes": "gt-section gt-band", "flex_gap": {"column": "20", "row": "20", "unit": "px", "size": 20}, "background_background": "classic", "background_color": "#EBE5DB"}, "elements": [{"id": "e5e32bc", "elType": "container", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "row", "_css_classes": "gt-row", "flex_direction_tablet": "column", "flex_direction_mobile": "column", "flex_align_items": "center", "flex_gap": {"column": "48", "row": "32", "unit": "px", "size": 48}, "flex_gap_tablet": {"column": "32", "row": "32", "unit": "px", "size": 32}}, "elements": [{"id": "5ac4e88", "elType": "container", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "_css_classes": "gt-col", "flex_gap": {"column": "20", "row": "20", "unit": "px", "size": 20}, "width": {"unit": "%", "size": 50.0}, "width_tablet": {"unit": "%", "size": 100}, "width_mobile": {"unit": "%", "size": 100}}, "elements": [{"id": "1a97c0d", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "About anxiety", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "gt-h2"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "e4f9190", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "What anxiety tends to feel like day to day", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "gt-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "4a17058", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Anxiety is rarely one big moment. More often it is a low hum that runs underneath everything: the email you re-read four times, the phone call you put off until it becomes a problem, the Sunday evening that starts at lunchtime. Your body may be tight in a way you stop noticing. Sleep may be shallow. You may be very good at hiding it, which is its own kind of tiring.</p><p>People describe it differently. Some talk about dread, some about restlessness, some about a mind that will not stop planning for things that never happen. There is no right way to have it.</p>", "_css_classes": "gt-prose"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "7c7a437", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "When it is worth talking to somebody", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "gt-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "ecb4e59", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>You do not need to reach a threshold. If anxiety is shaping your decisions, costing you sleep, or making you smaller than you want to be, that is enough reason to talk to a therapist. You are allowed to seek help for something that other people would call manageable. You are also allowed to not come back after a first session if it is not right.</p>", "_css_classes": "gt-prose"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "b08f135", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "What kinds of therapy people work with for anxiety", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "gt-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "0c2aa24", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Several approaches are commonly used, and the therapists listed here describe theirs in their own words. Cognitive behavioural therapy works with the link between thoughts, feelings and what you do next. Person-centred and humanistic approaches give you room to say what is happening without being steered. Psychodynamic work looks at where patterns come from. Many therapists describe themselves as integrative, meaning they draw on more than one approach depending on the person in front of them.</p><p>None of these is ranked here. Which one suits you depends on how you like to work and who you can talk to. A therapist's profile should explain their approach plainly. If it does not, ask.</p>", "_css_classes": "gt-prose"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "c4913e4", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "What a first session about anxiety tends to cover", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "gt-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "f364970", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>A first session is usually a conversation about what has been happening, how long it has been going on, and what you would like to be different. The therapist may ask what you have already tried. You can ask how they work and what a typical run of sessions looks like. Nothing needs to be decided in the room. Most therapists expect you to go away and think about whether it felt right.</p>", "_css_classes": "gt-prose"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "1835ea4", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"note-panel\" style=\"margin-top:2rem\"><p class=\"note-panel__title\">If you need help now</p><p>Gototherapy is a directory, not an emergency service. If you are in immediate danger call 999. For other urgent support see the <a href=\"/crisis/\">urgent support page</a>.</p></div>"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": true}, {"id": "6909a39", "elType": "container", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "_css_classes": "gt-col", "flex_gap": {"column": "20", "row": "20", "unit": "px", "size": 20}, "width": {"unit": "%", "size": 50.0}, "width_tablet": {"unit": "%", "size": 100}, "width_mobile": {"unit": "%", "size": 100}}, "elements": [{"id": "54b4703", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "image", "settings": {"image": {"url": "https://aririkushimeikito.github.io/gototheraphy/assets/images/session-sunlit-conversation-500.jpg", "id": 0, "alt": "Anxiety: a quiet room where a conversation can happen", "source": "library"}, "image_size": "full", "caption_source": "none", "_css_classes": "gt-photo gt-photo--wide"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": true}], "isInner": true}], "isInner": false}, {"id": "beb4c29", "elType": "container", "settings": {"content_width": "boxed", "flex_direction": "column", "_css_classes": "gt-section gt-section--tight", "flex_gap": {"column": "20", "row": "20", "unit": "px", "size": 20}}, "elements": [{"id": "247e1de", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Anxiety therapists by town", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "gt-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "30ca67d", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<ul class=\"link-grid\" style=\"margin-top:1.25rem\"><li><a href=\"/counselling/brighton/anxiety/\">Anxiety in Brighton</a></li><li><a href=\"/counselling/manchester/anxiety/\">Anxiety in Manchester</a></li></ul>"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": false}, {"id": "1f6151b", "elType": "container", "settings": {"content_width": "boxed", "flex_direction": "column", "_css_classes": "gt-section gt-section--tight gt-section--flush-top", "flex_gap": {"column": "20", "row": "20", "unit": "px", "size": 20}}, "elements": [{"id": "da8cafe", "elType": "container", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "row", "_css_classes": "gt-row gt-grid", "flex_direction_tablet": "column", "flex_direction_mobile": "column", "flex_align_items": "center", "flex_gap": {"column": "48", "row": "32", "unit": "px", "size": 48}, "flex_gap_tablet": {"column": "32", "row": "32", "unit": "px", "size": 32}}, "elements": [{"id": "8c375d6", "elType": "container", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "_css_classes": "gt-col", "flex_gap": {"column": "20", "row": "20", "unit": "px", "size": 20}, "width": {"unit": "%", "size": 33.33}, "width_tablet": {"unit": "%", "size": 100}, "width_mobile": {"unit": "%", "size": 100}}, "elements": [{"id": "3e2ed8f", "elType": "container", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "_css_classes": "gt-card", "flex_gap": {"column": "20", "row": "20", "unit": "px", "size": 20}}, "elements": [{"id": "d9936da", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "What happens in a first therapy session?", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "gt-h3", "link": {"url": "/stories/what-happens-in-a-first-therapy-session/", "is_external": "", "nofollow": "", "custom_attributes": ""}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "e96f9c2", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>What the first hour is for, and why you do not have to decide anything in the room.</p>", "_css_classes": "gt-soft"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": true}], "isInner": true}, {"id": "0d08fb6", "elType": "container", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "_css_classes": "gt-col", "flex_gap": {"column": "20", "row": "20", "unit": "px", "size": 20}, "width": {"unit": "%", "size": 33.33}, "width_tablet": {"unit": "%", "size": 100}, "width_mobile": {"unit": "%", "size": 100}}, "elements": [{"id": "ee9f458", "elType": "container", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "_css_classes": "gt-card", "flex_gap": {"column": "20", "row": "20", "unit": "px", "size": 20}}, "elements": [{"id": "0fcac32", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Can I have therapy online?", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "gt-h3", "link": {"url": "/online-counselling/", "is_external": "", "nofollow": "", "custom_attributes": ""}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "c49d49a", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Who it suits, what changes when the room is a screen, and how to set it up.</p>", "_css_classes": "gt-soft"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": true}], "isInner": true}, {"id": "3edbd57", "elType": "container", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "_css_classes": "gt-col", "flex_gap": {"column": "20", "row": "20", "unit": "px", "size": 20}, "width": {"unit": "%", "size": 33.33}, "width_tablet": {"unit": "%", "size": 100}, "width_mobile": {"unit": "%", "size": 100}}, "elements": [{"id": "dbc3729", "elType": "container", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "_css_classes": "gt-card", "flex_gap": {"column": "20", "row": "20", "unit": "px", "size": 20}}, "elements": [{"id": "d0ed622", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "What was checked", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "gt-h3", "link": {"url": "/how-we-verify/", "is_external": "", "nofollow": "", "custom_attributes": ""}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "79c6dbe", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Registration, insurance and supervision, checked by a person, per role.</p>", "_css_classes": "gt-soft"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": true}], "isInner": true}], "isInner": true}], "isInner": false}]}